h1('Ranked hypothesis matrix')
p('Status refers to the mechanism and available evidence, not proof of stock mispricing. Supported means the direction is established; plausible means consistent with evidence but unmeasured; weak means insufficient support for a base-case assumption; contradicted means available facts oppose the claim. Economic importance is qualitative because consensus operating estimates and a finished valuation are unavailable.')
